Tauri Skills is an original synthesis based primarily on the official
Tauri v2 documentation.

The project structure and selected general Tauri workflow ideas were informed
by `tauri-v2` from `nodnarbnitram/claude-code-extensions`, distributed under
the MIT License:

Copyright (c) 2025 Brandon Martin
https://github.com/nodnarbnitram/claude-code-extensions

The topics of capability management and Node.js sidecar lifecycle were also
evaluated against public community Skills. Text from repositories without an
explicit redistribution license was not copied into this project.
